#: kservicelistwidget.cpp:83
msgid ""
"This is a list of applications associated with files of the selected file type. "
"This list is shown in Konqueror's context menus when you select \"Open "
"With...\". If more than one application is associated with this file type, then "
"the list is ordered by priority with the uppermost item taking precedence over "
"the others."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is 'n lys van applikasies wat geassosieer is met die gekose lêer tipe. "
"Hierdie lys word vertoon in Konqueror se konteks kiesbalke wanneer jy \"Open "
"Met...\" kies. Indien meer as een applikasie geassosieer is met die lêer tipe, "
"word hierdie lys gesorteer in prioriteits orde en waar die heel boonste item "
"verhewe is bo die ander."

#: kservicelistwidget.cpp:88
msgid ""
"This is a list of services associated with files of the selected file type. "
"This list is shown in Konqueror's context menus when you select a \"Preview "
"with...\" option. If more than one application is associated with this file "
"type, then the list is ordered by priority with the uppermost item taking "
"precedence over the others."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is 'n lys van dienste wat geassosieer is met die gekose lêer tipe. "
"Hierdie lys word vertoon in Konqueror se konteks kiesbalke wanneer jy "
"\"Voorskou Met...\" kies. Indien meer as een applikasie geassosieer is met die "
"lêer tipe, word hierdie lys gesorteer in prioriteits orde en waar die heel "
"boonste item verhewe is bo die ander."

#: kservicelistwidget.cpp:97
msgid "Move &Up"
msgstr "Beweeg Boontoe"

#: kservicelistwidget.cpp:103
msgid ""
"Assigns a higher priority to the selected\n"
"application, moving it up in the list. Note:  This\n"
"only affects the selected application if the file type is\n"
"associated with more than one application."
msgstr ""
"Ken 'n hoër prioriteit aan die gekose\n"
"applikasie toe, deur dit op te beweeg in die lys. Nota:  Hierdie\n"
"affekteer slegs die gekose applikasie as die lêer tipe \n"
" met meer as een aansoek geassosieer is."

#: kservicelistwidget.cpp:107
msgid ""
"Assigns a higher priority to the selected\n"
"service, moving it up in the list."
msgstr ""
"Ken 'n hoër prioriteit toe aan die gekose\n"
"diens, deur dit op te beweeg in die lys."

#: kservicelistwidget.cpp:110
msgid "Move &Down"
msgstr "Beweeg Ondertoe"

#: kservicelistwidget.cpp:116
msgid ""
"Assigns a lower priority to the selected\n"
"application, moving it down in the list. Note: This \n"
"only affects the selected application if the file type is\n"
"associated with more than one application."
msgstr ""
"Ken 'n laer prioriteit toe aan die gekose \n"
"applikasie, deur dit ondertoe te beweeg in die lys. Nota: Hierdie \n"
"word slegs geaffekteer indien die gekose applikasie en die lêer tipe \n"
"met meer as een applikasie geassosieer word."

#: kservicelistwidget.cpp:120
msgid ""
"Assigns a lower priority to the selected\n"
"service, moving it down in the list."
msgstr ""
"Ken 'n laer prioriteit toe aan die gekose\n"
"diens, deur dit af in die lys te beweeg."

