#: kservicelistwidget.cpp:348
msgid "The service <b>%1</b> can not be removed."
msgstr "Die diens <b>%1</b> kan nie verwyder word nie."

#: kservicelistwidget.cpp:349
msgid ""
"The service is listed here because it has been associated with the <b>%1</b> "
"(%2) file type and files of type <b>%3</b> (%4) are per definition also of type "
"<b>%5</b>."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie diens is hier gelys omdat dit met die <b>%1</b> "
"(%2) lêer tipe geassosieer is en lêers van tipe <b>%3</b> "
"(%4) is per definisie ook van tipe <b>%5</b>."

#: kservicelistwidget.cpp:353
msgid ""
"Either select the <b>%1</b> file type to remove the service from there or move "
"the service down to deprecate it."
msgstr ""
"Kies die <b>%1</b> lêer tipe om die diens te verwyder of skuif die diens "
"afwaarts om die prioriteit te depressieer."

#: kservicelistwidget.cpp:356
